From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean O'Hollaren <sean.ohollaren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:31:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] FM-1: move with the six lowest keys, one key each for fire
 and use; no screen link speed button

The three low black keys are turn left, forward, turn right (F#3 G#3 A#3); the white keys under
them strafe left, back, strafe right (F3 G3 A3). B3 and C4 do nothing now, and the low F# no
longer runs (the high F# still does). Fire is F5 (and REC), use is G5: E5 and D5, which doubled
them, do nothing. LFO no longer steps the screen link's clock: the game keeps the fastest rate.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/fm1/fm1.h          |  2 --
 src/fm1/fm1_controls.c | 24 +++++++++---------------
 src/fm1/fm1_web.c      |  1 -
 3 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

